          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">If a Dimachaeron kills one or more enemy INFANTRY models in the Fight phase with its gasping talons and thorax spine-maw, it gains a 5+ invulnerable save for the remainder of the battle.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
